## Extention: Binding.sys

## KEY
# Close window (alt-x)
# Maximize (alt-m)
# Full-screen Maximize (alt-f)
# Minimize (thumbnail) (alt-t)

## Key commands
# A = Alt
# C = Control
# S = Shift
# M = Meta (Alt)
# Super = WinIcon

## KEY-MOUSE BINDINGS (untag below lines)

## Maximize alt-m
Silent Key m A M Maximize 100 100 # width hight

## Full-screen Maximize alt-f
Silent Key f A M ToggleMaximize

## Minimize (thumbnail) alt-t
Silent Key t A M Thumbnail

## Close alt-x
Silent Key x A M Close
